@group A
@commands boot
@pass `Done (`; mod list has `blockheads_additions`; no mixin error naming `BlockStateCounterTopperMixin`, `CfbOven*`, `CfbCorner*`; no `Duplicate capability key` / `creativeengineering:corner_storage` error; `config/blockheads_additions-common.toml` written with `[kitchen]`; no `[blockheads_additions] could not add the wood racks`
