## SQ-KT-23 | 40 wood racks: recipes, slab tag, mineable
@group A
@commands recipe probe (RecipeManager id dump) and `/dumptags`
@pass 40 `creativedelight:shaped/<wood>_spice_rack` / `_tool_rack` recipes; `cookingforblockheads:spice_rack` and `tool_rack` take `#creativedelight:rack_slabs/other`, which holds no `minecraft:oak_slab` but holds `quark:blossom_planks_slab`; the 40 racks in `#minecraft:mineable/axe`
@fails `kitchen.js` errors in `/kubejs errors`; `CD.on('blockheads_additions')` false (member switch)
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
> zq recipes _spice_rack
> zq recipes _tool_rack
> zq itemtag creativedelight:rack_slabs/other
> zq blocktag minecraft:mineable/axe
> zq rdetail cookingforblockheads:spice_rack
count creativedelight:shaped/[a-z_]+_spice_rack >= 20
count creativedelight:shaped/[a-z_]+_tool_rack >= 20
expect itemtag creativedelight:rack_slabs/other .*quark:blossom_planks_slab
reject itemtag creativedelight:rack_slabs/other .*minecraft:oak_slab
look 40 rack recipes (20 + 20); cookingforblockheads:spice_rack and tool_rack take #creativedelight:rack_slabs/other; mineable/axe lists the racks (blocktag line is long; grep spice_rack)

## SQ-KT-24 | oak spice rack block entity keeps and drops items
@group A
@commands `/setblock` an oak wall, `/setblock ~ ~ ~ cookingforblockheads:oak_spice_rack[facing=north]`; `/data get block ~ ~ ~`; put an item in through `/item replace block ~ ~ ~ container.0 with minecraft:sugar`; break it with a bot
@pass block entity data present (CfB's spice rack items list); the sugar drops with the rack
@fails no block entity: the BE type's valid blocks (SQ-KT-22 rack error)
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
> setblock 40 -60 1 minecraft:oak_planks
> setblock 40 -60 0 cookingforblockheads:oak_spice_rack[facing=north]
> data get block 40 -60 0
> item replace block 40 -60 0 container.0 with minecraft:sugar
> data get block 40 -60 0
expect minecraft:sugar
> kill @e[type=item]
> setblock 40 -60 0 minecraft:air destroy
sleep 2
> execute positioned 40 -60 0 as @e[type=item,distance=..3] run data get entity @s Item.id
expect "minecraft:sugar"
> kill @e[type=item]

